    "detailed_description": "<h1>Destruction simulator</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>What have we got here? Welp it's simple...<br>Just some water with a bunch of bouyant bodies, you'd say &quot;so what?&quot;<br>You can set up water parameters like waves altitude, speed, water level, densiry and some more.<br>What do you do with that?<br>Just drop some ships there and watch them &quot;having fun&quot;, and yeah you can build something yourself.<br>Still mot enough, welp, you dont really like those ships if you are asking - yes, there are some explosives too, alright, now go nuke it all.<br>And yeah dont forget to switch your map to one with some rocks...<br><br>In current state there are 5 explosives and 5 maps, but we will make shure to add more if you'd really like to, but I think it's enough to kill 30 mins",
